<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Genbel yr net asset value up 44 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Genbel yr net asset value up 44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - net asset value     2,372.0     vs 1,643.0</p>
<p>- Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) share price</p>
<p>				  2,360.0     vs 1,380.0</p>
<p>Full name: Genbel South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said that a capitalisation share award will be made to shareholders registered in the investment trust's books on August 15. The award will be in the ratio that 45 cents multiplied by 1.07 bears to the weighted average traded price of the firm's shares on the JSE for the four trading days ending October 6.</p>
<p>Shareholders can also receive a cash payment of 45.0 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
